      "text": "[From the U.K.]  I am becoming increasing disillusioned with my home country; especially the Government, past and present.  Broken promises and serving certain 'undesirables' before their own citizens including the sick, poor, elderly and Veterans.\nAll I see now is corruption and evil.  😭\n\nWe have beautiful countryside and a great history/heritage, for which I am grateful and I am very patriotic but...Sweden and Poland appear to have a more appealing way of life.\nSweden, having such an excellent, recycling and power production policy is brilliant!  👍💓\n\nI am 65 and approaching retirement and this video makes me seriously consider leaving.\n\nII would not be too far from the U.K. and with Internet/MS Teams/Social Media etc I could still keep in touch with family and friends.\n\nI love my food and will try (almost) anything and especially love seafood. I have eaten your fermented fish! 👍\nPerhaps I can organise a 2 week visit in the next couple of years, although I am caring for my 90 y.o. parents at the moment.",
